WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:03.200
Sikong Zheng! Do you think I fear you?!

00:03.480 --> 00:08.500
I, Sikong Yao, walk upright and act with an open conscience! The truth will inevitably come to light!

00:08.720 --> 00:11.000
When that day comes, let us see how you answer!

00:13.760 --> 00:18.000
Since you refuse to confess, you shall taste the agony of the lash!

00:20.000 --> 00:22.500
Flog him! As you command!
